r  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3310104529616725\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqEvcvozmwUQ4YdeybDzqfEBbiceWzLZbJytUAswcGMKm4Kh4cy2WY0ZQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"861\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">后续转将的时候也要注意，要尽量避免重复兵种过多。<br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">举例：</span></strong>赵云-关羽组合，分别是骑兵弓兵、步兵弓兵，已经有两个弓兵兵种了，后续需避免养主弓兵的角色，不然导致弓兵技能碎片紧缺。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4367816091954023\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqIHic9Jj87dbtOCOt8WezXjoVsPIk9uj5cvSYLyHMXRzxBvsTs67kViaw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1044\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">武将培养方面，可以从<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>等级</strong></span>、<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">星级</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">兵种</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">技能</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">装备</span></strong>方面进行培养。其中技能和装备是提升战力比较多的，要优先升上来（第一天最高可以升到8级）。如果技能碎片不够，可以在【书院-传承】中进行分解，或者在【商肆】中进行购买。建议前期只分解自己需要的技能碎片，暂时用不上的武将先不要分解，一方面是为了省银币，另一方面后续升级府邸是有武将星级的要求的，留着以备不时之需。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\">如果不清楚自己所养的将应该学什么技能、带什么装备，可以在<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>尚书台</strong></span>中查看互助问答、或者聊天频道中问问指导员“小诸葛”，我相信他们一定会热情的帮你解答的。</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin-top: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(54, 54, 54);\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(194, 167, 125);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"margin-top: 3px;text-align: center;transform: translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;\"><section style=\"transform: scale(1.33);transform-origin: left top;margin-bottom: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"line-height: 1;\"><section style=\"width: 0px;display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;border-left: 1em solid rgb(194, 167, 125);border-top: 1em solid transparent !important;border-bottom: 1em solid transparent !important;\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;padding-left: 15px;\"><section style=\"\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong>主线与建筑</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin-bottom: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;padding: 22px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">根据主线任务进行推进即可，第一天最高可以推进到<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>主线任务第6章</strong></span>。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.40925925925925927\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqricW8Wu7lSjrewQib9YgjYdhHicr5Zyt2xapotfKNyiaicyCaPYSqC0X6Zg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">在做主线任务的过程中，可同步将<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>府邸升级到8级</strong></span>。每次府邸升级都有相应的建筑升级条件，而每次建筑升级都需要一定的时间。如果不愿意等待，可以使用沙漏进行加速。当然，元宝也可以直接完成建筑升级，但建议还是留到后续。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6397608370702541\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqnOpVEPHck2VRQ0eSSoecQJnQL3k6G0l4q0PZMGNltqXycXWhDIjVjQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"669\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">因为第一天<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>军务数量</strong></span>的限制（<span style=\"color: rgb(142, 31, 50);\">军务次数非常非常非常重要，每天都需要尽量买满</span>），<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">爵位最高可以升到中大夫，府邸升至8级，拜将台3级，4个军营8级，8个资源建筑8级，演义台2级，群英馆8级，辎重站8级，书院2级，码头1级，商肆1级。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">这里按照个人的游戏理解，给到一个升级顺序：<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>府邸&gt;8个资源建筑&gt;4个军营&gt;书院&gt;演义台</strong></span>、<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>群英馆&gt;辎重站</strong></span>（码头、商肆只有1级）</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">每次建筑升级都会需要一定的材料。前期如果升级建筑次数较多，那么木头会十分缺少。所以在建筑升级的过程中，可以<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">同步去攻城做巡城任务</span></strong>，每次巡城都会获得一定量的资源。具体的攻城开荒路线，会在后面去介绍。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.551980198019802\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqu81KDPru4hrLqMcYyQHiaoJQWAwpAfVRkNIZViaU93Wmj6sKZrHOWXCA/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"808\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin-top: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(54, 54, 54);\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(194, 167, 125);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"margin-top: 3px;text-align: center;transform: translate3d(4px, 0px, 0px);\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: stretch;min-width: 5%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;\"><section style=\"transform: scale(1.33);transform-origin: left top;margin-bottom: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"line-height: 1;\"><section style=\"width: 0px;display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;border-left: 1em solid rgb(194, 167, 125);border-top: 1em solid transparent !important;border-bottom: 1em solid transparent !important;\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;padding-left: 15px;\"><section style=\"\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong>进阶建议</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin-bottom: 10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;padding: 22px;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">最后就是充值方面的了，这个就丰俭由人，大家看对应自身的需求看就好。</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">首先会有个<span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>首充活动</strong></span>，一共分为4个档，首先第一档包含坐骑-赤兔马、5w银币、1个合击英雄自选箱、5个黄金沙漏、10个点将令以及5个锦囊，这里因为是首充任意金额即可，所以6元就可以了。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.51552210724365\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqULkLpQ57wyElEqUzN6ePZ58lVB5GmgC2Pjp79E2afub6KTKwMr0ZGA/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1063\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\"><strong>第二档</strong></span>充值30元，可以获得5w银币、1个宿命英雄自选箱、5个黄金沙漏、10个点将令、5个锦囊以及20个马缰。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5400192864030858\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqNQFMlic4zGnnklqcDna2BkgSfNnFiclS7NFuwopu6QZc72h75rXaJ7zw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1037\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">第三档</span></strong>充值68元，将可获得5w银币、1个合击英雄自选箱、5个黄金沙漏、10个点将令、5个锦囊以及40个马缰。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5019120458891013\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqlAtK6NBau4Yb4ibJRvlAMlEUdOd08UBy0licAPGiasrsKjswpB7eDmaaQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1046\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 167, 125);\">第四档</span></strong>充值128元，将可获得5w银币、1个宿命英雄自选箱、5个黄金沙漏、10个点将令、5个锦囊以及80个马缰。</p><section style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: normal;\"><br  /></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5246212121212122\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YuLicnhrCKNF5LYFPoE5ia2PhUMHZOVbbqXEgL6MIfUhAgYpc9Osicjz8nFJGxJXfsEfiaYfELhoNM97Ee7OaeKYug/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1056\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(102, 72, 62);line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br  /></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">如果是有充值想法的话，这里个人建议是在升级府邸前将这4个档奖励先依次拿完，首先先充6元，将赤兔马拿到手后，找个将装备上。等一会，系统会自动弹出登峰造极的活动页